{
    "name": "ESP32 HUB75 Ring DMA",
    "version": "3.0.14-ring.1",
    "description": "Memory-light fork of ESP32-HUB75-MatrixPanel-DMA: streams bit planes through a small ring from a compact 24-bit framebuffer (about 33 KiB for a 64x64 panel at 8-bit colour, double buffered) and removes the mid-panel scan seam.",
    "keywords": "hub75, esp32, esp32s2, esp32s3, display, dma, rgb matrix",
    "repository": {
        "type": "git",
        "url": ""
    },
